  m_text: "1 - Use the radar to track enemy missiles. The radar is located on the
    ship's bow, so don't forget to turn.\n\n2 - Use the antenna knob to fine\u2011tune
    the signal direction.\n\n3 - Lock the antenna once you have aimed it at the target.
    This will allow you to connect to the missile."
