  m_text: "Signal control panel.\n\nTo destroy missiles, you must transmit a special
    signal that is generated based on the missile's characteristics.\n\n1 - Bit switches
    \u2013 needed to correctly identify the target.\n\n2 - Missile guidance method.\n\n3
    - Press \xABSend Signal\xBB when you are sure you have set all missile parameters
    correctly.\n\nIf everything is done according to the instructions, the missile
    will be destroyed."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e221bb206d4b54840a13043f81985747, type: 2}
